    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Paul Lafferty Ltd. Auctioneers are delighted to present New to the Market, this charming Three-Bedroom Bungalow on a c. 0.5 acres site in Tibohine, Castlerea, Co. Roscommon."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation briefly consists of Kitchen / Dining Room, Sitting Room, Three Bedrooms and a Bathroom. The property benefits from mains water and a septic tank system contained within the site boundary.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property has the benefit of a Lawned Garden Area to the front and rear and has a galvanised steel shed for additional storage. The property has had external upgrades in the form of PVC doors and windows. \r\n\r\nCan also be purchased with an additional c. 28.11 acres of land in one lot with old ancillary farm buildings.\r\nc. 16 acres of good quality land located to the side and rear of the residence and lands across the Fairymount / Tibohine Road.\r\nc. 12 acres of good to excellent quality land located across the road from the residence and includes one ancillary farm building, yard and the crush, with mains water and live electricity supply."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "While the property requires modernisation, it retains a number of attractive original features including internal doors and feature fireplaces, offering excellent potential to create a beautiful family or holiday home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The property is located in an excellent location, around a 5-minute drive from Ballaghaderreen Town Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\nFor further details, please contact Sole Selling Agents Paul Lafferty Ltd. Auctioneers."
      }
    ],
